
Your job will be to add a dev container specification for this git repo.

The specifications for this dev container will be in the standard .devcontainer directory in a devcontainer.json
file and accompanying optional docker files. 

This dev container will be used with Visual Studio code for database development using the open source dbt processor. 

The container should be built with an appropriate version of python and the dbt-core, dbt-postgres and dbt-duckdb 
libraries installed.

You can build and check the container with the devcontainer command-line tool which is already installed in this environment.

A successful build will result in running "dbt build" for this project in the container without run errors. The build runs
successfully in the current enviroment. 

Document the project.

